```java
private String scope(boolean sales) {
    return sales ? " AND c.owner_user_id=? " : "";
}
// 销售员追加"只能看自己的"，管理员不加限制
```

### ⑧ `filters()` + `args()` — 动态可选筛选条件

```java
private String filters(String type, String from, String to) {
    StringBuilder s = new StringBuilder();
    if (type != null && !type.isBlank()) s.append(" AND f.follow_type=?");
    if (from != null && !from.isBlank()) s.append(" AND DATE(f.follow_time)>=?");
    if (to   != null && !to.isBlank())   s.append(" AND DATE(f.follow_time)<=?");
    return s.toString();
}

private Object[] args(..., Object... tail) {
    List<Object> a = new ArrayList<>();
    if (type != null && !type.isBlank()) a.add(type);
    if (from != null && !from.isBlank()) a.add(from);
    // ... 与 filters 的问号顺序必须完全一致
    Collections.addAll(a, tail);
    return a.toArray();
}
```

